This is the fourth of five introductory messages about comp.sources.games.
The first described how to submit sources to comp.sources.games, where
the archive sites are, and how to contact them.  The second posting is
a list of sources posted to this newsgroup arranged by volume/issue
number.  The third provides a listing of the Archive-name, the
Volume/Issue and the Subject for each posting.  The fifth posting is an
index of sources in the games archive on saab.  This posting lists the
an index of the patches that have been posted in c.s.g.

The patchfile column is the posted Archive-name: of the patch. The Patch 
volume and issue columns indicate the Volume/Issue of the posted patch. 
The Initial volume and issue columns indicate the Volume/Issue(s) of the 
articles the patch applies to.

